## Article 332. Leaving cassation complaint without motion, returning cassation complaint

```catala
declaration scope Article332CassationLeaveReturn:
  input leaveCheck content CassationLeaveCheck
  input returnCheck content CassationReturnCheck
  output leftWithoutMotion content YesNo
  output returned content YesNo
  output twentyDayDeadlineForLeaveDecision content YesNo

scope Article332CassationLeaveReturn:
# Left without motion when requirements not met or deadline expired without restoration
  label leave_requirements definition leftWithoutMotion under condition
    leaveCheck.complaintMeetsRequirements = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label leave_deadline definition leftWithoutMotion under condition
    leaveCheck.deadlineExpired = Yes
    and leaveCheck.restorationRequested = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label leave_restoration_invalid definition leftWithoutMotion under condition
    leaveCheck.deadlineExpired = Yes
    and leaveCheck.restorationRequested = Yes
    and leaveCheck.restorationGroundsValid = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_leave definition leftWithoutMotion equals No

# Returned when filed by incapable, unsigned, wrong method, withdrawn, or no grounds
  label return_incapable definition returned under condition
    returnCheck.returnGround = CassationReturnGround.FiledByIncapablePerson
    consequence equals Yes

  label return_unsigned definition returned under condition
    returnCheck.returnGround = CassationReturnGround.NotSignedOrUnauthorized
    consequence equals Yes

  label return_wrong_method definition returned under condition
    returnCheck.returnGround = CassationReturnGround.FiledWrongMethod
    consequence equals Yes

  label return_withdrawn definition returned under condition
    returnCheck.returnGround = CassationReturnGround.WithdrawnBeforeOpening
    consequence equals Yes

  label return_no_grounds definition returned under condition
    returnCheck.returnGround = CassationReturnGround.NoCassationGroundsSpecified
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_return definition returned equals No

# Twenty day deadline for leave decision
  label twenty_days definition twentyDayDeadlineForLeaveDecision equals Yes
```

## Article 333. Refusal to open cassation proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article333CassationRefusal:
  input check content CassationRefusalCheck
  output refusalToOpenProceedings content YesNo

scope Article333CassationRefusal:
# Refuse when decision not cassationable
  label not_cassationable definition refusalToOpenProceedings under condition
    check.decisionNotCassationable = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Refuse when previous closure with withdrawal
  label previous_closure definition refusalToOpenProceedings under condition
    check.previousClosureWithWithdrawal = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Refuse when previous refusal for same person same decision
  label previous_refusal definition refusalToOpenProceedings under condition
    check.previousRefusalSamePerson = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Refuse when deadline expired without restoration
  label deadline_expired definition refusalToOpenProceedings under condition
    check.deadlineExpiredWithoutRestoration = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Refuse when complaint unfounded
  label unfounded definition refusalToOpenProceedings under condition
    check.complaintUnfounded = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Refuse when Supreme Court conclusion already applied correctly
  label conclusion_applied definition refusalToOpenProceedings under condition
    check.supremeCourtConclusionAlreadyApplied = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Refuse when correct law application is obvious (rulings)
  label obvious definition refusalToOpenProceedings under condition
    check.correctLawApplicationObvious = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Refuse when cassation decision cannot form unified practice
  label no_practice definition refusalToOpenProceedings under condition
    check.cassationDecisionCannotFormPractice = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# One year absolute deadline for prosecutor/authority
  label one_year_absolute definition refusalToOpenProceedings under condition
    check.oneYearSinceFullDecision = Yes
    and check.isProsecutorOrAuthority = Yes
    and check.authorityNotNotifiedOfCase = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_refusal definition refusalToOpenProceedings equals No
```

## Article 334. Opening cassation proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article334CassationOpening:
  input check content CassationOpeningCheck
  output proceedingsOpened content YesNo
  output twentyDayDecisionDeadline content YesNo
  output panelOfThreeRequired content YesNo

scope Article334CassationOpening:
# Open when no grounds for leave, return, or refusal
  label open definition proceedingsOpened under condition
    check.noGroundsForLeave = Yes
    and check.noGroundsForReturn = Yes
    and check.noGroundsForRefusal = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_opened definition proceedingsOpened equals No

# Decision within 20 days
  label twenty_days definition twentyDayDecisionDeadline equals Yes

# Panel of three judges
  label three_judges definition panelOfThreeRequired equals Yes
```

## Article 335. Sending copies to participants

```catala
declaration scope Article335SendingCopies:
  output copiesMustBeSentToParticipants content YesNo

scope Article335SendingCopies:
# Court sends copies of cassation complaint to all participants
  label must_send definition copiesMustBeSentToParticipants equals Yes
```

## Article 336. Joining cassation complaint

```catala
declaration scope Article336CassationJoin:
  input check content CassationJoinCheck
  output joiningAllowed content YesNo

scope Article336CassationJoin:
# Participants and affected non-participants may join before review starts
  label join_participant definition joiningAllowed under condition
    check.filedByParticipant = Yes
    and check.filedBeforeCassationReviewStarted = Yes
    and check.courtFeePaid = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label join_nonparticipant definition joiningAllowed under condition
    check.filedByNonParticipantWithRights = Yes
    and check.filedBeforeCassationReviewStarted = Yes
    and check.courtFeePaid = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_join definition joiningAllowed equals No
```

## Article 337. Supplementing, amending, recalling cassation complaint

```catala
declaration scope Article337CassationAmendment:
  input check content CassationAmendmentCheck
  output amendmentAllowed content YesNo
  output recallAllowed content YesNo
  output withdrawalAfterOpeningAllowed content YesNo

scope Article337CassationAmendment:
# May supplement or amend within cassation deadline
  label amend definition amendmentAllowed under condition
    check.withinCassationDeadline = Yes
    and check.copiesSentToOtherParticipants = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_amend_deadline definition amendmentAllowed under condition
    check.withinCassationDeadline = No
    consequence equals No

  label no_amend_copies definition amendmentAllowed under condition
    check.copiesSentToOtherParticipants = No
    consequence equals No

# May recall before opening of proceedings
  label recall definition recallAllowed under condition
    check.withdrawnBeforeOpening = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_recall definition recallAllowed equals No

# Withdrawal after opening closes proceedings unless joined persons object
  label withdrawal_allowed definition withdrawalAfterOpeningAllowed under condition
    check.withdrawnAfterOpening = Yes
    and check.otherJoinedPersonsObject = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label withdrawal_objected definition withdrawalAfterOpeningAllowed under condition
    check.withdrawnAfterOpening = Yes
    and check.otherJoinedPersonsObject = Yes
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 338. Response to cassation complaint

```catala
declaration scope Article338CassationResponse:
  input check content CassationResponseCheck
  output responseAccepted content YesNo
  output absenceOfResponseNotPreclusive content YesNo

scope Article338CassationResponse:
# Response accepted when filed within court-set deadline
  label accepted definition responseAccepted under condition
    check.filedWithinCourtDeadline = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_accepted definition responseAccepted under condition
    check.filedWithinCourtDeadline = No
    consequence equals No

# Absence of response does not prevent review
  label not_preclusive definition absenceOfResponseNotPreclusive equals Yes
```

## Article 339. Closure of cassation proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article339CassationClosure:
  input check content CassationClosureCheck
  output cassationProceedingsClosed content YesNo

scope Article339CassationClosure:
# Close when withdrawal after opening and no objections from joined persons
  label withdrawal definition cassationProceedingsClosed under condition
    check.closureGround = CassationClosureGround.WithdrawalAfterOpening
    and check.otherJoinedPersonsObject = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label withdrawal_objected definition cassationProceedingsClosed under condition
    check.closureGround = CassationClosureGround.WithdrawalAfterOpening
    and check.otherJoinedPersonsObject = Yes
    consequence equals No

# Close when unsigned or incapable discovered after opening
  label incapable definition cassationProceedingsClosed under condition
    check.closureGround = CassationClosureGround.UnsignedOrIncapableAfterOpening
    consequence equals Yes

# Close when non-participant's rights not actually decided
  label not_decided definition cassationProceedingsClosed under condition
    check.closureGround = CassationClosureGround.NonParticipantRightsNotDecided
    consequence equals Yes

# Close when Supreme Court conclusion already exists
  label conclusion_exists definition cassationProceedingsClosed under condition
    check.closureGround = CassationClosureGround.SupremeCourtConclusionAlreadyExists
    consequence equals Yes

# Close when legal relations not similar
  label not_similar definition cassationProceedingsClosed under condition
    check.closureGround = CassationClosureGround.LegalRelationsNotSimilar
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_closure definition cassationProceedingsClosed equals No
```
